WEBVTT

23:38.944 --> 23:41.613
- (PUP VANS)
- Gods, but they grow fast.

23:44.074 --> 23:45.575
Brandon!

23:45.701 --> 23:48.704
I saw the king.
He's got hundreds of people.

23:48.829 --> 23:51.915
How many times have I told you?
No climbing.

23:52.040 --> 23:55.002
But he's coming right now, down our road.
